{"resourceIdentifier":"689","resourceName":"Reforestation of degraded land in Chhattisgarh, India","description":"The land to be reforested under the project activity has been a degraded land and would have continued to degrade in the absence of the project activity. The natural land conditions did not permit arrival and establishment of forest propagules. The project area is a revenue area, obtained from the villagers and secluded from the forest lands. The lands under project activity are locally known as Bhata Lands that have poor water holding capacity; no vegetation and are heavily prone to wind and water erosion. Thus, the major purposes of the project activity are to: 1. Enhance carbon sink through reforestation. 2. Reclaim the degraded land in a sustainable manner 3. Reduce pressure on natural forests of the region 4. Uplift socio-economic status of native rural","location":{"latitude":21.543921,"longitude":81.254260},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"689"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chattishgarh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Prakash Industries Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 0455 8702818"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"689"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"689"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5007"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":4402}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","v